{"id":"523fadf1703582fe","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-min-operator-generalized.md","title":"Generalized Minimization Operator on Predicates","display":"df-min-operator-generalized — Generalized Minimization Operator on Predicates","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-min-operator-generalized","aliases":["90-df-min-operator-generalized"],"display":"df-min-operator-generalized — Generalized Minimization Operator on Predicates","depends_on":["[[90-df-omega]]","[[90-df-partial-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-min-operator-generalized"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-min-operator-generalized</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-min-operator-generalized — Generalized Minimization Operator on Predicates"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9846c377383d14c1\" href=\"?note=9846c377383d14c1\" title=\"90-df-omega\">90-df-omega</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e860bc8bff2a4e39\" href=\"?note=e860bc8bff2a4e39\" title=\"90-df-partial-function\">90-df-partial-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{k+1}\">\\(P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\)</span> 为任意关系，不预设可判定或可枚举；自然数及次序见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9846c377383d14c1\" href=\"?note=9846c377383d14c1\" title=\"90-df-omega\">90-df-omega</a>，部分函数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e860bc8bff2a4e39\" href=\"?note=e860bc8bff2a4e39\" title=\"90-df-partial-function\">90-df-partial-function</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,y,z\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,y,z\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 的元素是平铺的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(k+1)\">\\((k+1)\\)</span> 元有限列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu P\">\\(\\mu P\\)</span> 的元素是“输入元组—输出”的有序对；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\frown\">\\(\\frown\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle n\\rangle\">\\(\\langle n\\rangle\\)</span> 分别取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9846c377383d14c1\" href=\"?note=9846c377383d14c1\" title=\"90-df-omega\">90-df-omega</a> 的集合论有限列连接与一元列，不是自然数序列码。下式定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(\\vec x,n)\">\\(P(\\vec x,n)\\)</span> 的分组实参记号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nP(\\vec x,n)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\vec x{}^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle\\in P,\\\\\n\\mu P&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\vec x,n)\\in\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N:\nP(\\vec x,n)\\land\\forall z&lt;n\\ \\neg P(\\vec x,z)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu P)&amp;=\\{\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ P(\\vec x,n)\\},\\\\\n\\mu P&amp;:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N,\\\\\n\\mu y\\,P(\\vec x,y)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\mu P)(\\vec x)\n\\quad(\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu P)),\\\\\n(\\mu y\\,P(\\vec x,y))=n&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\nP(\\vec x,n)\\land\\forall z&lt;n\\ \\neg P(\\vec x,z)\n\\quad(\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu P)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nP(\\vec x,n)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\vec x{}^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle\\in P,\\\\\n\\mu P&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\vec x,n)\\in\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N:\nP(\\vec x,n)\\land\\forall z&lt;n\\ \\neg P(\\vec x,z)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu P)&amp;=\\{\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ P(\\vec x,n)\\},\\\\\n\\mu P&amp;:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N,\\\\\n\\mu y\\,P(\\vec x,y)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\mu P)(\\vec x)\n\\quad(\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu P)),\\\\\n(\\mu y\\,P(\\vec x,y))=n&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\nP(\\vec x,n)\\land\\forall z&lt;n\\ \\neg P(\\vec x,z)\n\\quad(\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu P)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>自然数良序性给出唯一的最小见证。图、定义域与点值记号的适用范围均已在 Assertion 中给出；关系本身不预设可计算。计算性结论仍使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"99273534f93e4ad1\" href=\"?note=99273534f93e4ad1\" title=\"90-thm-min-closure-rec\">90-thm-min-closure-rec</a> 的额外前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"9846c377383d14c1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"e860bc8bff2a4e39","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"9846c377383d14c1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$、$P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{k+1}$ 为任意关系，不预设可判定或可枚举；自然数及次序见 [[90-df-omega]]，部分函数见 [[90-df-partial-function]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"e860bc8bff2a4e39","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$、$P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{k+1}$ 为任意关系，不预设可判定或可枚举；自然数及次序见 [[90-df-omega]]，部分函数见 [[90-df-partial-function]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"9846c377383d14c1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k$、$n,y,z\\in\\mathbb N$。$P$ 的元素是平铺的 $(k+1)$ 元有限列，$\\mu P$ 的元素是“输入元组—输出”的有序对；$\\frown$ 与 $\\langle n\\rangle$ 分别取 [[90-df-omega]] 的集合论有限列连接与一元列，不是自然数序列码。下式定义 $P(\\vec x,n)$ 的分组实参记号。","embed":false},{"target":"90-thm-min-closure-rec","status":"resolved","id":"99273534f93e4ad1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"自然数良序性给出唯一的最小见证。图、定义域与点值记号的适用范围均已在 Assertion 中给出；关系本身不预设可计算。计算性结论仍使用 [[90-thm-min-closure-rec]] 的额外前提。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{k+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k","display":false},{"tex":"n,y,z\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"(k+1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu P","display":false},{"tex":"\\frown","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle n\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"P(\\vec x,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nP(\\vec x,n)&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\vec x{}^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle\\in P,\\\\\n\\mu P&\\coloneqq\\{(\\vec x,n)\\in\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N:\nP(\\vec x,n)\\land\\forall z<n\\ \\neg P(\\vec x,z)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu P)&=\\{\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ P(\\vec x,n)\\},\\\\\n\\mu P&:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N,\\\\\n\\mu y\\,P(\\vec x,y)&\\coloneqq(\\mu P)(\\vec x)\n\\quad(\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu P)),\\\\\n(\\mu y\\,P(\\vec x,y))=n&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\nP(\\vec x,n)\\land\\forall z<n\\ \\neg P(\\vec x,z)\n\\quad(\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu P)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1835,"backlinks":[{"id":"19a3e9309cfd35f0","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mu$ 见 [[90-df-min-operator-generalized]]；$\\simeq$ 是 [[90-df-program-numbering]] 所引用的部分函数外延相等，$\\circ$ 是 [[90-df-relation]] 的关系图复合。集合推导式中的 $\\frown$、$\\langle y\\rangle$ 是集合论有限列连接和一元列，不是自然数序列码。"},{"id":"73df8af25850d4b3","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$；函数类与谓词类见 [[90-df-recursive-function-class]]、[[90-df-primitive-recursive]]；$\\mu$ 见 [[90-df-min-operator-generalized]]，$\\simeq$ 是 [[90-df-program-numbering]] 所引用的部分函数外延相等，$\\circ$ 取 [[90-df-relation]] 的关系图复合。集合推导式中的 $\\frown$、$\\langle y\\rangle$ 为集合论有限列连接和一元列，不是自然数序列码。"},{"id":"ccbc0a46c077469a","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mu$ 见 [[90-df-min-operator-generalized]]；$\\simeq$ 是 [[90-df-program-numbering]] 所引用的部分函数外延相等，$\\circ$ 是 [[90-df-relation]] 的关系图复合。集合推导式中的 $\\frown$、$\\langle y\\rangle$ 是集合论有限列连接和一元列，不是自然数序列码。"},{"id":"99273534f93e4ad1","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f:=\\mu P$ 取 [[90-df-min-operator-generalized]] 的最小化部分函数图；元数为 $k$。自然数语境保留原引用 [[90-df-omega]]。"},{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-53","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-min-operator]]、[[90-df-min-operator-generalized]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-53","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[90-df-addition-function.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetic-language.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[90-df-berry-paradox.md]]\n[[90-df-cantor-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-df-closure-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-comparison-function.md]]\n[[90-df-compcode.md]]\n[[90-df-composition-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-conditional-function.md]]\n[[90-df-conf-proj.md]]\n[[90-df-configuration.md]]\n[[90-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[90-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[90-df-decidable-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-closure.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonalization.md]]\n[[90-df-divisibility.md]]\n[[90-df-divrem-function.md]]\n[[90-df-effective-procedure.md]]\n[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system-definition.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system.md]]\n